--- R1 fBm(H), periodic complete reads
  argmin = (c*(2*H + 1)/(2*H*W*q))**(1/(2*H + 1))
  |FOC at argmin| max over random points (must be ~0): 0.0e+00
  a = 1/(2*H + 1): max|a - claim| = 0.0e+00;  b = 1/(2*H + 1): max|b - claim| = 0.0e+00
  spend share c/T*/phi = 2H/(1+2H): max dev 0.0e+00
  convexity d2J/dT2 at T* > 0: sqrt(2)*W**(3/2)*q**(3/2)/(2*sqrt(c))
--- R1 Brownian, |e|^p loss
  argmin = (c**2*(p + 2)**2/(W**2*m_p**2*p**2*q**p))**(1/(p + 2))
  |FOC at argmin| max over random points (must be ~0): 5.2e-172
  a = 2/(p + 2): max|a - claim| = 5.2e-172;  b = p/(p + 2): max|b - claim| = 1.0e-171
  e_g=-(1-b)/(1-a) = -2/p
--- R1 alpha-stable, |e|^p
  argmin = (c*(alpha + p)/(C*W*p*q**(p/alpha)))**(alpha/(alpha + p))
  |FOC at argmin| max over random points (must be ~0): 2.1e-171
  a = alpha/(alpha + p): max|a - claim| = 5.2e-172;  b = p/(alpha + p): max|b - claim| = 1.0e-171
  e_g=-(1-b)/(1-a) = -alpha/p
--- R2 entropy-priced channel (Brownian, quadratic)
  argmin = sqrt(2)*sqrt(W)*sqrt(q)/(2*sqrt(lambda))
  |FOC at argmin| max over random points (must be ~0): 0.0e+00
  a = 1/2   b = 1/2
--- Kalman-Bucy steady state P = [sqrt(q)*sqrt(r)]
  info rate P/(2r) = sqrt(q)/(2*sqrt(r))  ; P expressed via rate kappa: q/(2*kappa)
--- A_theta averaging (precision cost c' r^-theta)
  argmin = (4*cprime**2*theta**2/(W**2*q))**(1/(2*theta + 1))
  |FOC at argmin| max over random points (must be ~0): 2.1e-171
  a = 2*theta/(2*theta + 1): max|a - claim| = 2.1e-171;  b = theta/(2*theta + 1): max|b - claim| = 5.2e-172
  b - a/2 = 0    e_g=-(1-b)/(1-a) = -theta - 1    (b-a)/(1-a) = -theta
  spend share = 1/(1+2theta): max dev 1.0e-171
  theta=1: a=2/3, b=1/3, phi=3*2**(1/3)*W**(2/3)*cprime**(1/3)*q**(1/3)/2
  theta=1/2: a=1/2, b=1/4, phi=2*sqrt(W)*sqrt(cprime)*q**(1/4)
--- A_1 averaging, absolute loss (lone member)
  argmin = 2*2**(1/5)*pi**(2/5)*cprime**(4/5)/(W**(4/5)*q**(1/5))
  |FOC at argmin| max over random points (must be ~0): 0.0e+00
  a = 4/5   b = 1/5
  member-measured e_pred=-(1-b)/(1-a) = -4

=== numeric: brute-force minimisation vs closed forms, 2000 random parameter sets per class ===
  max error R1fBm: 9.03e-16
  max error Atheta: 6.32e-16
  max error A_a: 4.90e-12
  max error A_b: 4.65e-12

Kalman-Bucy Riccati by ODE integration (q=0.3, r=2): P(200)=0.77459685 vs sqrt(qr)=0.77459667
